%% Proposed end-to-end workflow (RECOMMENDATION). ⛔ = approval gate (policy-configurable)
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Intake
  Intake --> Spec: request recorded
  Spec --> SpecApproval: draft spec + acceptance criteria
  SpecApproval --> Plan: ⛔ approved (or auto at L3+)
  SpecApproval --> Spec: changes requested
  Plan --> PlanApproval: tasks + dependency DAG + file ownership
  PlanApproval --> Execute: ⛔ approved (or auto at L2+)
  Execute --> Verify: task result schema-valid
  Verify --> Execute: checks failed (retry<N)
  Verify --> Review: engine-run checks green
  Review --> Execute: blocking findings
  Review --> Integrate: no blocking findings
  Integrate --> DeliveryApproval: isolated branch rebased + re-verified
  DeliveryApproval --> Deliver: ⛔ approved (merge/PR/deploy per policy)
  Deliver --> [*]
  Execute --> Failed: retry budget exhausted
  Execute --> Canceled: user cancel
  Failed --> Execute: human resume
  note right of Execute: parallel tasks only if disjoint write sets
